<%- include('../partials/header', {title:'Create account — FindIt'}) %><div class="auth-wrap"><div class="auth-aside"><span class="eyebrow light">GOOD THINGS HAPPEN TOGETHER</span><h1>Be part of the<br>connection.</h1><p>Create an account to report items, contact people and keep track of your reports.</p><div class="auth-quote">“A small act of honesty can make someone's whole day.”</div></div><div class="auth-card"><span class="eyebrow">JOIN FINDIT</span><h2>Create your account</h2><p class="muted">It only takes a minute to get started.</p><form method="POST" action="/register" class="form-stack"><label>Full name<input name="name" required maxlength="60" placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="8" required placeholder="At least 8 characters"></label><label>Confirm password<input name="confirmPassword" type="password" minlength="8" required placeholder="Re-enter password"></label><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-pill w-100">Create account</button></form><p class="auth-switch">Already have an account? <a href="/login">Log in</a></p></div></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
